    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296131</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『なりきり士』の説明を聞きますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hear an explanation on "Roleplayers"?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288652</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>へっへっへっへぇ～。
やっとこ落ち着いただ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hehehehehh~ A
little peace and
relaxation at last~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288740</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ところでさっきの話の
続きだけド……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, um, about what
we were talking
about before...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288980</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わーってるだぁ、
せかすでねーって。
んだば……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, I hear ya.
No need to go
rushin' me. Now...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288980</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おめぇら
もう１３歳だなや？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You kids are 13 years
old now, aren't ya?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288980</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そういうことで、そろそろ
『なりきり士』の仕事を始める
年頃なわけだーよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And so, on account of your
age, it's high time ya started
doin' some "Roleplayer" work.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289052</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『なりきり士』……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Roleplayer"...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Review. Narikiri's?</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289380</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おぉ『なりきり士』っつーのは、
その服装の人になりきる力を
持った人間のことを言うだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Y'see, a "Roleplayer" is someone who's
got a special power what let's 'em play
whatever role their clothes are suited for.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Review. Narikiri's?</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289380</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>剣士の服を着れば立派な剣士で、
魔法使いの服を着てみれば、
魔法使いになれるっつー具合だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A swordsman's clothes? They'll make a fine
swordsman. Change to a mage's clothes?
Now they're a proper mage. Real convenient.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289380</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おめぇらふたりには、
そんだら力が生まれたときから
宿っとるんだーよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The two of ya have had
that power restin' inside
ya since you were born.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289456</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わたしたちに？　まさか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We do? No way...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289572</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はん！
おらが信じられねぇってが？
このおらをか？　あ～ん？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph! Ya saying you don't
believe me? You're doubtin'
my fine, distinguished self? Huh?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289948</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>グダグダ言ってねぇで、
おらの中の服、
着てみりゃわかるだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Rather than wafflin' on like this,
better'd ya just try on some of the
clothes I've got inside me. You'll see.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289948</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>とにかく、『なりきり士』の力で
困ってる人たちを
助ける仕事をするんだど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Anyway, you'll be helpin' out people
who are struggling, with your
"Roleplayer" powers. That's the work.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289948</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ノルン様はそれをおめぇらに
期待しとるっちゅーわけだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's what the Great Norn's
expectin' of ya, y'see.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290224</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それ……すごいいいかも！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That...sounds kinda
awesome, actually!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290224</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オレ、困ってる人、
助けに行くよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay, I'm gonna help
some people with
their "struggles"!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290224</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オレ、外に出る！
『なりきり士』の仕事する！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm gonna go out there and
do some "Roleplayer" work!</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Review. Narikiri?</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290980</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_028&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そんなの……
&lt;Dio&gt;ひとりだけで
行かせられると思う？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can't just... You don't really
think we'll let you do that
all on your own, do you, &lt;Dio&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290980</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_029&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>すぐ無茶するし、
危なっかしいし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You'll just do something
reckless, and probably get
yourself in trouble, so...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291308</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_033&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わかった……
わたしも一緒に行く</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay... I'm
coming with you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291376</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_034&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おまえも……！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You, too...!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291888</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_040&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん。いいよ……
行っておいで</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay. That's fine... I'll
be waiting for you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291948</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_041&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>っしゃ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hell yeah!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292032</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_042&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>何言ってるの。
エトも一緒だよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What are you talking
about? Aren't you
coming too, Ethos?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292116</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_043&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>え……ぼくも……
行っていいの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh... Are you okay
with...me coming along?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292180</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_044&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>一緒に行こ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Come with us!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292336</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_045&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そっか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292336</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_046&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん！　&lt;Dio&gt;と&lt;Mel&gt;は
ぼくの可愛い双子だもん。
ぼくも一緒でなきゃね！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay! &lt;Dio&gt; and &lt;Mel&gt; are *my*
twin cuties, after all, so of
course I have to come with you!</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Review translation.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292580</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_048&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ？　話はまとまっただな？
んだら、準備してやるだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh? Have ya wrapped
up your talkin'? Then
let's get ready and go.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292580</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_049&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『なりきり士』のことを
教えてほしいだか？
ん？　ん？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Would ya like me to
explain "Roleplayers" to
ya? Would ya? Hmm?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まず&lt;TRIANGLE&gt;でメニューを開くだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>First, press &lt;Triangle&gt;
to open the Menu.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295236</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『コスチューム』の項目で、
服を着ることができるだーよ。
今は１着ずつしかないんだど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If ya select "Costume," then you
can change your clothes. Ya've
only got one set each, for now.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Just need reviewed by a translator.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295332</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『コスチューム』は世界の
どこかに落ちてたりする
もんだーよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Costumes" are just
lyin' around all over
the world, really.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Just need reviewed by a translator.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295428</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>服を着替えっと、
その服の格好に応じた
戦闘特性になるだで</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whenever ya change your
clothes, your battle style will
change to match 'em.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Just need reviewed by a translator.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おめぇらにわかりやすく教えっと、
『剣士』だと、
剣士としての能力が上がるだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>To explain it for ya real simple like...
If you wear a "Swordsman" costume,
your ability with a sword will go up.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Just need reviewed by a translator.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295652</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>つまりだ、本物の剣士と同じよう
に剣を振って攻撃ができるように
なるんだでよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In other words, you'll be able to
swing and attack with your sword
just like a real swordsman would.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Just need reviewed by a translator.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295760</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でもただただ『コスチューム』
を集めて、着てるだけでは
芸がないんだべ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But if ya just gather up the
"Costumes" and throw 'em on,
ya won't be all that skilled.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Just need reviewed by a translator.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>戦闘でもらえるＣＰっちゅーの
を溜めると、熟練度が上がって
スキルが開放できるだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ya can get "CP" during battles, and
if ya save up enough of it, your
mastery'll increase, releasin' new skills.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Just need reviewed by a translator.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293460</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_057&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>とまぁ、こんなところだ。おらが
こんな説明までせねばなんねぇ
とはまったくめんどうくせぇ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And well, that about sums it up. Just
lettin' you know, but it's real annoyin'
that I have to explain all this to ya.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Just need reviewed by a translator.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293460</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_058&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それから、おらは豆粒みたいに
ちっちゃくなって
おめぇらについてくだーよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So from here on, I'll be
shrinkin' myself down real tiny
like, and stickin' right to ya.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293916</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_061&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あー、あとな、おらは、
魔物のいるところは、
絶対出ていがねぇからな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, right, and ya won't get
me comin' out when there
are monsters around, either.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293916</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_062&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうしても着替えてぇなら、
魔物のいない町中とか、
安全な場所にするだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If ya really need to change yer clothes,
you'll want to go somewhere without any
monsters. A town, or somethin' like that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293984</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_063&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>さ！　行くか！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>C'mon! Are we
going or not!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294056</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_064&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>行くって……どこへ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Where should we
even go, though...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294268</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_067&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;ヴァルハラ村&lt;White&gt;はどうかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How about &lt;Red&gt;Valhalla Village&lt;White&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294340</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_068&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;ヴァルハラ村&lt;White&gt;？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Red&gt;Valhalla Village&lt;White&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294560</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_069&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そう。ヴァルハラ平原に貧しい人たちが
移り住んで作った村なんだけド</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right. So, it's a village on the
Valhalla Plains, built by people in
poverty who had moved there.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294560</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_070&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>たくさん人が集まってる場所
なんだから、困ってる人だって
きっといるんじゃないのかな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A lot of people live there, so I'm
pretty sure at least some of
them have to be struggling.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294640</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_071&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>んじゃー
そこ行ってみようぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>'Kay. Then, let's
try going there.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295052</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_040_077&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あなたたちの旅立ちに
祝福を……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I pray that you may find safety
and fortune on your travels...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
